§CC: the build function, deferred by name

Records a deferral rather than designing anything. Two local deploys (FCPM contact-sheets,
NCCV bin/deploy) now share a skeleton; the three questions that would decide a shared function's
shape (what a build produces, whose access it runs on, fault vs withdrawal) are open, so it is
not written.

